WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:15.841
If I had a hot air balloon, I could fly around the world.

2
00:00:15.842 --> 00:00:20.551
I could fly to China.

3
00:00:20.552 --> 00:00:26.272
I could see the Great Wall and pandas.

4
00:00:26.273 --> 00:00:30.713
I could fly to Australia.

5
00:00:30.714 --> 00:00:37.434
I could see koalas and kangaroos.

6
00:00:37.435 --> 00:00:41.012
I could fly to France.

7
00:00:41.013 --> 00:00:47.836
I could see the Eiffel Tower and eat baguettes.

8
00:00:47.837 --> 00:00:50.653
I could fly to Holland.

9
00:00:50.654 --> 00:00:56.299
I could see windmills and tulips.

10
00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.472
I could fly to Egypt.

11
00:00:59.473 --> 00:01:05.130
I could see pyramids and the Nile River.

12
00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:08.115
I could fly to England.

13
00:01:08.116 --> 00:01:14.754
I could see the Tower of London and Big Ben.

14
00:01:14.755 --> 00:01:17.735
I could fly to America.

15
00:01:17.736 --> 00:01:22.998
I could see the Statue of Liberty and New York City.

16
00:01:22.999 --> 00:01:26.265
I could fly to Switzerland.

17
00:01:26.266 --> 00:01:31.084
I could see the Alps and skiers.

18
00:01:31.085 --> 00:01:39.454
If you had a hot air balloon, where could you fly?
